# Demo Part 2: Track a coloured object using rectangle/contour detection
# - Set HSV colour range at the top, run, and it starts searching immediately
# - Detects object by finding coloured contours and fitting a bounding rectangle
# - Locks when a rectangle is big enough AND near the centre of frame
# - All output is printed to the terminal — no display or stream needed

